Origin: EmberBSD, AI-assisted.
with_advisory_lock 7.6.0 requires Ruby >= 3.3 and Active Record >= 7.2,
but the recipe accepted only Ruby 3.3 and 3.4, so with Ruby 4.0 alone it
failed with "Unknown Ruby version specified: 33". Drop the Ruby version
pin. The package is for Redmine, not only for Redmine 6.0 and 6.1.
Not submitted upstream.

--- a/databases/ruby-with_advisory_lock/Makefile
+++ b/databases/ruby-with_advisory_lock/Makefile
@@ -11,10 +11,8 @@
 
 DEPENDS+=	${RUBY_ACTIVERECORD_DEPENDS}
 
-RUBY_VERSIONS_ACCEPTED=	33 34
-
 #
-# This pacakge is for redmine60 and redmine61
+# This package is for Redmine.
 #
 RUBY_RAILS_ACCEPTED=	81
 
